Step O: attach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Step P: authorize_transport_leg_loading transport_leg_alpha origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha
Step Q: detach_task_profile origin_availability_alpha route_task_profile_alpha   (optional, not needed further)

Now we have transport leg assembled and loading authorized.

Now we need to execute dispatch on shift_candidate_alpha: we have dispatch_allocated shift_candidate_alpha true, candidate_vehicle_linked shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma true, candidate_dispatch_slot_linked shift_candidate_alpha dispatch_slot_alpha true, not dispatched shift_candidate_alpha true.

Step R: execute_schedule_dispatch shift_candidate_alpha vehicle_unit_gamma dispatch_slot_alpha

Now we need to release compliance certificate:

Step S: release_compliance_certificate shift_candidate_alpha compliance_certificate_alpha

